; Names in the 48 BASIC of the 128K ROM 1, where it differs from the
; 48K ROM, for the Xpeccy+ debugger.
;
; Names and data ranges from "Spectrum 128 ROM 1 Disassembly" (13 December 2011) by
; Geoff Wearmouth and Paul Farrow
; (http://www.fruitcake.plus.com/Sinclair/Spectrum128/ROMDisassembly/), used with
; Paul Farrow's permission (e-mail of 2026-11-13: "Sure, feel free. If it helps
; the debugger in your emulator then great!"). Not covered by the MIT license of
; Xpeccy+. Changed for Xpeccy+ on 2026-11-13: a hyphen in a name written as an
; underscore; data ranges from his DEFB (db), DEFW (da) and DEFM (text) lines.
;
; The cells his file does not name: Klive IDE's names.
;
; Names from Klive IDE's ROM annotations, file sp128-1.rom.dis
; (https://github.com/Dotneteer/kliveide, src/public/roms, commit e227b87c,
; 2026-11-06), MIT license:
